      "created_at": "2022-04-13T17:37:44.364Z",
      "cooked": "<p>For me at least, the Device Assembly Line discarding the top of each deck helped avoid the Apocalypse (see the spoiler in my original post). It was much easier when my setup didn’t get ruined part way through. Don’t recall the details of this one, but as a bonus the Assembly Line may ditch some of Apostate’s relics or demons.</p>",
