      "id": 244530,
      "name": "Ami Silbeman",
      "username": "Asymptotic-Aardvark",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/258eb7/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2022-04-14T13:46:14.848Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Did you prioritize getting rid of artifacts, tanks, or just hitting Apostate? I’ve tried all of those and none of them work. The worst is when I get rid of the darn sword and then it comes back the next turn. Also, I’ve found that just as I’m getting him down (flipping him, with only one or so artifacts), he runs out of deck, reshuffles, and then hits me with three or four artifacts.</p>\n<p>How do you use Bunker? Plinking away, or using his base power? I generally try and load up the omni-cannon, but I’m not sure that it is a good approach. Also, I’ve been using Wraith’s stun-gun to reduce damage, but again, without a lot of success.</p>",
