      "created_at": "2022-04-15T08:42:36.725Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I managed to take Apostate down using your method. It was very nip and tuck, and all heroes were under 5 HP. The frightening thing was that he reshuffled his deck the turn I took him down, playing Apocalypse. Fortunately, he had no relics, and between Wraith destroying her toys and Bunker’s loaded Omni-cannon I was able to take him down. (I had previously gotten him to this point, but on his play after re-shuffling he produced two relics which proceeded to kill everyone.</p>",
